      "when": "[Opponent's Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) or [either player's Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), after an enemy unit picks its targets.",
      "target": "An **ADEPTA SORORITAS INFANTRY** unit of yours that is a target of any of that enemy unit's attacks, or else one of your **ADEPTA SORORITAS JUMP PACK** units up to 3\" from such a unit.",
      "effect": "Attacks against the unit get -1 to [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls) for the rest of the phase. If the target is a **JUMP PACK** unit, attacks against your **ADEPTA SORORITAS INFANTRY** units also get -1 to Hit while those units are up to 3\" from it, for the rest of the phase."
